    {
      "id": "ae97f732-e89d-496b-9532-dec9e057527d",
      "type": "embed://a2/generate.bgl.json#module:main",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "PRODUCT PROMPT",
        "visual": {
          "x": 800,
          "y": -120
        },
        "userModified": true
      },
      "configuration": {
        "config$prompt": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Act as an expert prompt engineer and product creation strategist. Generate a complete, ready-to-use set of mega-prompts designed to build a full digital product kit from scratch for {{\"type\":\"in\",\"path\":\"7004cf35-9226-4fe5-b0f3-6cbecd7e8207\",\"title\":\"2\"}}.\n\nStructure the output into 3 distinct phases following this exact breakdown:\n\nPHASE 1: THE CORE DOCUMENTS (The Product Itself)\nGenerate 4 highly detailed AI prompts to create the primary digital assets:\n\n- Prompt 1: The Main Master Guide (Actionable, step-by-step instruction manual with zero fluff).\n- Prompt 2: The Core Operational Feature / Worksheet (A structured template, table, or printable tracker).\n- Prompt 3: The Continuity / Emergency / Hand-Off Document (A template for long-term management, delegating, or contingency planning).\n- Prompt 4: The Safety & Execution Checklist (A zero-risk verification system to prevent costly user mistakes).\n\nPHASE 2: THE MARKETING & SALES ASSETS (To Sell It)\nGenerate 2 AI prompts for the conversion engine:\n\n- Prompt 5: The High-Converting Sales Page Copy (Full sales page outline using classic copywriting formulas like PAS/AIDA, addressing objections, audience callouts, and guarantee).\n- Prompt 6: The Automated Email Sequence (A 5-day post-purchase/lead-nurture email sequence driving onboarding, retention, and reviews/cross-sells).\n\nPHASE 3: THE VALUE-ADD BONUS MATERIALS (To Increase Perceived Value)\nGenerate 4 AI prompts for bonuses and traffic generation:\n\n- Prompt 7: The \"Red Flag / Pitfalls\" Bonus Document (A high-value guide detailing major mistakes to avoid).\n- Prompt 8: The Buyer's / Tool Comparison Guide (A comparison asset highlighting top tools/resources, formatted with affiliate opportunities).\n- Prompt 9: The Long-Term Maintenance Tracker (A recurring audit/habit tracker for ongoing success).\n- Prompt 10: The Viral Social Media Campaign (A multi-post or long-form thread script designed to drive organic traffic directly to the offer).\n\nFor every prompt generated (1 through 10), make sure to:\n1. Assign a clear Role/Persona (e.g., \"Act as a top-tier copywriter\", \"Act as a senior expert...\").\n2. Define the exact tone, structure, page/word length, and formatting rules.\n3. Include specific placeholders, examples, and rules tailored to [INSERT PRODUCT PROJECT].\n"
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        },
        "generation-mode": "text-3-pro",
        "b-system-instruction": {
          "role": "user",
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "You are working as part of an AI system, so no chit-chat and no explaining what you're doing and why.\nDO NOT start with \"Okay\", or \"Alright\" or any preambles. Just the output, please."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
